{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"五味 - 标签","description":"这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。","home_page_url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://acuherb.xyz/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://acuherb.xyz/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"五味第五十六","date_published":"2025-09-15T17:24:11&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-08-27T08:47:44Z","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-56/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-56/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["五味"],"summary":"五味，系指酸、苦、甘、辛、咸五种味道。因文中主要论述了五味与五脏的配属关系及五脏病的五味宜禁，故称为\u0026quot;五味\u0026quot;。","content_html":"五味，系指酸、苦、甘、辛、咸五种味道。因文中主要论述了五味与五脏的配属关系及五脏病的五味宜禁，故称为\u0026quot;五味\u0026quot;。"}]}